<title>FRANCE: FRANCE STOCKS.</title>
<headline>FRANCE STOCKS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares eased on the back of stronger-than-expected  U.S. prices data in the July NAPM report, traders said.</p>
<p>The CAC index had previously clawed its way back into ground before  the U.S. report, which showed higher prices for the first time in  four months.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 index down 36.89, or 1.2 percent, at 3,038.78.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 August futures index down 42 at 3,040 from Thursday's close.</p>
